### PASS B: AXIS0-ONLY STEERED (K=1) — ÇIKTI + LOG ###

In the heart of a stormy coast stood Lighthouse Keepers Cove, where Eliza had lived for 30 years without ever seeing the vast ocean she was sworn to protect. Each day, she climbed the winding staircase to tend the light, guided by tales from sailors passing below. One foggy night, a ship in distress called out. Eliza listened intently but heard no waves crashing against rocks. As dawn broke, she stepped outside—only to find the sea before her eyes, stretching endlessly under a clear sky. She finally saw what generations of keepers safeguarded.

